<style id="brand-unify-luxury">
/* ============================================================================
   BRAND UNIFICATION — Emerald & Gold Luxury Theme
   The dashboard hero banner, control-panel and cards already use a deep
   emerald + gold palette (#0a2b19 / #0f3d26 / #e6c574 / #c9a24a). The sidebar
