<!-- Second payroll implementation removed (FIX 2, security/refactor audit).
     This page previously contained two parallel systems: the one above
     (setPayrollTab/renderPayroll, DB.employees flat salary model) is the one
     actually invoked by the app router (nav('payroll') -> renderPayroll()) and
     is the system kept in use. The removed block (switchPayrollTab,
     openPayrollModal->#payroll-modal, openSalaryModal->#mSalary, itemized
     DB.salaryHistory/DB.empAdvances model) was only ever triggered from its
     own now-removed buttons, so those three functions are now unreachable but
     harmless -- left in place rather than deleted from the script, in case any
     external data (DB.salaryHistory / DB.empAdvances) still needs a home later.
     Removes ~15 duplicate ids (pr-tab-employees, pr-tab-advances,
     pr-panel-employees, pr-panel-advances, pr-emp-count, pr-monthly-total,
     pr-total-advance, pr-total-loan, pr-paid-month, and related). -->
</div>


