       each card's 3 stacked rows — name+type / balance / account+"Statement →"
       — into one flex ROW, so labels ran side-by-side instead of stacked);
   (2) a `!important`-heavy theme reset on `button{padding...border...
       box-shadow...!important}` that flattened every card's border to
